<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-canvas text-fg">
    <%#
      Public legal pages: /terms, /privacy, /refunds, /contact. Razorpay reviews these before it
      activates live payments. Business details come from the admin panel → Integrations →
      "Business details". This text is a sensible starting point, not legal advice: have a lawyer
      or CA review it before you sell.
    %>
    <% const sellerName = business.name; %>
    <% const support = business.email ? business.email : 'the support email on our Contact page'; %>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6">
      <header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <a href="/" aria-label="Pirento Blank home" class="focus-ring inline-flex min-h-6 items-center"><%- include('../partials/brand') %></a>
        <nav aria-label="Legal pages" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
          <% for (const [slug, name] of Object.entries(pages)) { %>
            <a href="/<%= slug %>" class="focus-ring underline-offset-2 hover:underline <%= slug === page ? 'font-semibold' : 'text-muted' %>" <%- slug === page ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' %>><%= name %></a>
          <% } %>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold"><%= title %></h1>

        <% if (page === 'terms') { %>
          <p>These terms apply to Pirento Blank (the "service"), run by <strong><%= sellerName %></strong>. By creating an account or paying for Premium you agree to them.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">1. What the service is</h2>
          <p>Pirento Blank is a software tool for keeping a trading journal, measuring your own results, planning trades and practising with paper trades. It is <strong>not</strong> investment advice, a research report or a recommendation to buy or sell anything. <%= sellerName %> is not registered with SEBI as an investment adviser or research analyst. AI-written text in the service is a review of your own data and may be wrong. You alone decide and are responsible for every trade.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">2. Your account</h2>
          <p>Keep your password and authenticator safe. You are responsible for what happens under your account. We may suspend accounts that abuse the service, attack it, share access or break the law.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">3. Broker connections and orders</h2>
          <p>When you connect a broker (Zerodha, Dhan, Upstox, Fyers, Angel One) you authorise the service to read your fills and, only where you turn it on, place the orders you confirm. The broker's own terms apply. Market data, charges and P&amp;L shown in the service are estimates; your broker's contract notes are the record.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">4. Premium and payment</h2>
          <% if (plan.enabled) { %>
            <p>Premium costs <%= formatCurrency(plan.priceMonthly) %> a month<% if (plan.trialDays > 0) { %>, after a free trial of <%= plan.trialDays %> days (one per person)<% } %>. It renews every month through Razorpay until you cancel. See the <a class="underline" href="/refunds">cancellation and refund policy</a>.</p>
          <% } else { %>
            <p>The service is currently free. If paid plans start, the price, trial and renewal terms will be shown before you pay, and the <a class="underline" href="/refunds">cancellation and refund policy</a> will apply.</p>
          <% } %>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">5. Availability and liability</h2>
          <p>We work to keep the service running and your data safe, but it is provided "as is". To the extent the law allows, <%= sellerName %> is not liable for trading losses, missed trades, broker or data-provider outages, or indirect losses, and our total liability is limited to the fees you paid in the last three months.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">6. Changes and law</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms; the date below changes when we do, and continued use means you accept them. These terms are governed by the laws of India<% if (business.address) { %>, with courts at our registered address having jurisdiction<% } %>.</p>

        <% } else if (page === 'privacy') { %>
          <p>This policy explains what <strong><%= sellerName %></strong> collects in Pirento Blank, why, and your choices.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">What we store</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Your email, password hash (never the password), authenticator secrets (encrypted) and the devices you are signed in on.</li>
            <li>The journal you create: trades, notes, screenshots, strategies, rules, watchlist and settings.</li>
            <li>Broker access tokens when you connect a broker, stored encrypted and used only for what you turn on.</li>
            <li>Payment records from Razorpay (amount, date, status). Card, UPI and bank details are entered on Razorpay's page and never reach our servers.</li>
            <li>Basic server logs (time, page, error codes) to keep the service secure. We do not use advertising trackers.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">How it is used and shared</h2>
          <p>Your data is used only to run the service for you. We do not sell it. It is shared only with the providers needed to run features you use: Razorpay (payments), your broker, OpenAI (when you use an AI feature, the relevant part of your journal is sent to it), Telegram (messages you opt in to) and our email provider. Someone you give a mentor share link to can read that shared journal.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Cookies</h2>
          <p>One sign-in cookie keeps you signed in. Your theme and language choices are kept in your browser.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Your choices</h2>
          <p>You can export all your data from Settings at any time. To correct or delete your account and data, write to <%= support %>; we act within 30 days, except records the law requires us to keep (such as payment records).</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Grievances</h2>
          <p>Grievance officer: <%= business.grievanceOfficer || sellerName %><% if (business.email) { %>, <a class="underline" href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a><% } %>. We acknowledge complaints within 24 hours and resolve them within 15 days.</p>

        <% } else if (page === 'refunds') { %>
          <p>This policy covers Premium subscriptions to Pirento Blank, sold by <strong><%= sellerName %></strong>. Nothing physical is shipped; Premium is delivered online as soon as payment succeeds.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Cancelling</h2>
          <p>Cancel any time in Settings → Plan &amp; billing. Renewal stops and you keep Premium until the end of the month you have paid for. If you cancel during the free trial, nothing is charged.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Refunds</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Monthly fees already paid are not refunded for the remaining days after you cancel.</li>
            <li>If you were charged twice, or charged after cancelling, write to <%= support %> within 30 days and we refund the extra charge in full.</li>
            <li>If Premium did not work for you because of a fault on our side that we could not fix, we refund that month on request.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Approved refunds are sent to the original payment method through Razorpay within 5–7 working days.</p>

        <% } else { %>
          <p>Questions about your account, Premium, payments or refunds: we usually reply within one working day.</p>
          <dl class="grid gap-3 rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-5 sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr]">
            <dt class="text-muted">Business</dt><dd><%= sellerName %></dd>
            <% if (business.email) { %><dt class="text-muted">Email</dt><dd><a class="underline" href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a></dd><% } %>
            <% if (business.phone) { %><dt class="text-muted">Phone</dt><dd><%= business.phone %></dd><% } %>
            <% if (business.address) { %><dt class="text-muted">Address</dt><dd class="break-words"><%= business.address %></dd><% } %>
          </dl>
        <% } %>

        <p class="text-xs text-muted">Last updated 18 October 2026.</p>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
